========================================================================
  THE KEY QUESTION: CAN EVERY TOURNAMENT FIND AN EVEN HP?
========================================================================

  Can every tournament choose an HP that gives an even graph?

  Classes with ≥1 even-graph HP: 3 / 12
  Classes with NO even-graph HP: 9 / 12

  SOME TOURNAMENTS CANNOT PRODUCE AN EVEN GRAPH!
  The bijection CANNOT be made even-graph-preserving for ALL classes.

